    "title": "Dublin at Bleckley County highlights: The End Zone Week 7 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Clayton Poulnott ,\n1 days ago COCHRAN, Georgia (41NBC/WMGT) — The Dublin Fighting Irish beat the Bleckley County Royals 27-21 Friday night in Week 7 of The End Zone. The Fighting Irish (4-1) beat Bleckley County 42-19 last year and had gone 18-2 vs. the Royals in the series history. The Royals (4-1) last beat... Read full article\n1",
